The game interaction sounds and also the menu screen were all created with VST SERUM using the Digital Work Station FL (Fruit Loops), under the responsibility of Guilherme Brites.

The engine sound when changing gears and the sound of the fuel running out were added.

- Low Fuel
- Enemy Explosion
- Menu up and down
- Menu Entry Music and Game Presentation
- Projectile (ship/plane shots)
- Second layer of low fuel
- Death sound (explosion + soundtrack). 4 versions
- Picking up Fuel
- Third layer of LOW fuel
- The intention was to provide more interactivity and immersion during the gameplay.
